  "description": "<div>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"82\" data-start=\"50\"><strong data-end=\"80\" data-start=\"55\">&bull; Brand Introduction:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"449\" data-start=\"83\"><strong>Munkra</strong> is a global platform connecting creators and conscious consumers through innovative and sustainable products. We curate a diverse range of eco-friendly, trend-forward, and high-quality items spanning fashion, cosmetics, lifestyle essentials, and more. Our mission is to promote responsible consumption while supporting ethical brands and visionary creators.</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"484\" data-start=\"451\"><strong data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"456\">&bull; Product Description:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"799\" data-start=\"485\">Our product lineup includes a wide variety of <strong data-end=\"626\" data-start=\"531\">fashion, accessories, beauty, sustainable lifestyle products, and eco-conscious essentials.</strong> We partner with innovative brands to offer unique, high-quality, and ethically produced items that resonate with modern consumers who value both style and sustainability.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"799\" data-start=\"485\"></p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"841\" data-start=\"801\"><strong data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"806\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1365\" data-start=\"842\">\r\n<li data-end=\"923\" data-start=\"842\"><strong data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"844\">High Commission Rate:</strong> Earn <strong data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"875\">12% commission</strong> on every sale you generate.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1029\" data-start=\"924\"><strong data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"926\">Diverse Product Selection:</strong> A wide range of high-quality, trend-setting, and sustainable products.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1132\" data-start=\"1030\"><strong data-end=\"1055\" data-start=\"1032\">Strong Brand Story:</strong> Promote a brand that values sustainability, innovation, and global impact.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1252\" data-start=\"1133\"><strong data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1135\">Easy-to-Use Affiliate System:</strong> Track your performance and commissions through our dedicated affiliate dashboard.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1365\" data-start=\"1253\"><strong data-end=\"1277\" data-start=\"1255\">Marketing Support:</strong> Get access to promotional materials, exclusive discounts, and early product releases.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1394\" data-start=\"1367\"><strong data-end=\"1392\" data-start=\"1372\">&bull; Payment Terms:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1616\" data-start=\"1395\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"1395\"><strong data-end=\"1417\" data-start=\"1397\">Commission Rate:</strong> 12% per successful sale.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1514\" data-start=\"1445\"><strong data-end=\"1465\" data-start=\"1447\">Payout Method:</strong> Payments are made via bank transfer or PayPal.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1616\" data-start=\"1515\"><strong data-end=\"1537\" data-start=\"1517\">Payout Schedule:</strong> Commissions are paid on a&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1581\" data-start=\"1564\">weekly basis</strong> with a minimum payout threshold.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1618\"><strong data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1623\">&bull; Other Information:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1974\" data-start=\"1650\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1788\" data-start=\"1650\"><strong data-end=\"1669\" data-start=\"1652\">Who Can Join?</strong> Content creators, influencers, bloggers, and digital marketers passionate about sustainable and innovative products.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1881\" data-start=\"1789\"><strong data-end=\"1808\" data-start=\"1791\">How to Apply?</strong> Sign up through our affiliate portal and get approved within 48 hours.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1974\" data-start=\"1882\"><strong data-end=\"1908\" data-start=\"1884\">Affiliate Dashboard:</strong> Easily track clicks, conversions, and commissions in real-time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>",
